WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:37.720
Dear Brother... I am at Saint-Juste-sama's funeral.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:44.500
<b>35. Beach of Dreams</b>

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.410
Dear Brother...

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:02.770
On her final day, the day she passed away,

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:06.790
...Saint-Juste-sama sent roses to Fukiko-sama.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:13.300
The day was also unusual in that she'd cleaned her apartment,

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:17.520
...and arranged to return a book to Kaoru-no-Kimi.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:22.310
For me... the special day was the one just before,

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.920
...when she promised to take me to see the sunset.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.200
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:35.280
She was enveloping us, all of us, with her happiness...

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:42.150
I'd rather not believe it was destiny,

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:45.370
...but it's as if she were passing on her happiness to us,

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.120
...knowing she must soon depart.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.640
Dear Brother...

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.200
After crying so much, my tears still will not stop.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.130
Fukiko, it is time now.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:40.370
Yes, Brother, I know.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.100
Fukiko...

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:51.820
But please, I just need two minutes.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.830
Would you leave Rei and I alone?

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:58.570
I want to say a final farewell, just the two of us.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.230
Very well.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.020
Excuse me, but we must take the coffin out now.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.970
Please... just five, no, ten minutes more. Please!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:21.190
But if we wait longer, I'm afraid the traffic will be bad.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:23.600
It's only ten more minutes!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:27.060
She only lived for 17 years. This is her last ten minutes!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.480
It is impossible to wait?

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:34.510
No matter what the reason is, surely you can wait ten minutes!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.080
Ichinomiya!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.040
Henmi...

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.710
Get a grip on yourself.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:58.880
Rei, were you watching?

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:04.150
During your entire funeral, I did not let one tear escape.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.910
I never allowed my emotions out.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:16.220
I remained calm and dignified as I accepted the many condolences.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:23.660
Yes, I was the proud Fukiko that you have always loved.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:34.510
...because you are the only one who can see my tears.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:40.630
My tears... my tears are for you only.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:41.890
Rei!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.470
Rei...

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.620
Rei... Rei!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.960
I loved you.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.030
Rei, I loved you.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.230
I did love you so!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:28.350
Now I must say good bye.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.010
I'll miss you.

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:05.750
See, I told you.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.310
See, I told you.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.860
It doesn't suit you.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.100
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:27.020
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:30.730
I'm so relieved! I was having a terrible dream.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:33.140
A very, very scary dream.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:42.750
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.480
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.540
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.070
And where shall it go, this body of mine?

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.710
At one with the wind, wherever it may lead, like a lone sea gull.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.120
Please. Please take me with you.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.380
I will fly. Higher... and higher...

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.220
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.310
...and higher!

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:26.020
Didn't I tell you? It doesn't suit you.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:37.340
Saint-Juste-sama -- I won't stay forever.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.590
But just a little longer...

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.070
I want to stay here in this dream just a bit more.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.690
Inside your dream... deep within your dream...

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:58.670
Dear Brother...

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.560
I couldn't sleep.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.500
Being unable to sleep, I went for a walk,

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.180
...and before I knew it I was at Saint-Juste-sama's apartment.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:13.350
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:30.020
What if... what if my emotions lead me to her room for a reason...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:37.450
There was definitely a flicker of light coming from that room!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.220
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.290
Miya-sama...?

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.980
I thought you were her.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:04.810
For a moment I thought you were her, coming back home.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.440
I'm so sorry.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.640
It's quite all right.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.450
I was merely dreaming.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:15.000
A dream that her death was just a dream...

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.290
I was feeling so grateful that it was only a dream...

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:23.980
Then I awoke, and realized I was here.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:47.300
It all must have seemed very peculiar to you --

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.230
The relationship between Rei and I.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:05.970
But I did love her.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:11.780
I had to be the only one she admired -- if not, I would become anxious...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:13.900
...terribly anxious...

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:20.880
Dear Brother...

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:25.640
With those words, Miya-sama became silent,

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:32.000
...and the two of us quietly stood there, staring out of the window.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:38.580
Through the window, we could see a canal -- and the bridge.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:43.080
Oh... yes! This is it!

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:46.430
This is the landscape Saint-Juste-sama looked over every morning.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:51.990
Now Miya-sama and I are looking out in place of Saint-Juste-sama.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:59.560
Saint-Juste-sama, can you see?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.300
It is almost dawn now.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.480
It begins without you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:12.220
A day is about to start without you.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:31.800
Nanako-san.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.040
Yes?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.840
If there is something that you like...

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.400
Yes?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:43.640
Today, my father and brother will come to clean out this room.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:49.400
Before they do... perhaps you would like to choose a memento of Rei.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:55.010
I'm sure Rei would be glad for you to have something.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.810
She liked you.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.490
Ma cherie la pupe.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.980
You look just like her.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:37.470
Very well. That will be fine, Nanako-san.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:43.600
Did you know this doll is one I gave to Rei?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.080
Yes.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.930
Yes. I gave it to her...

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.230
I won't be able to live with you,

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:55.240
...but keep this near you, and think of me always.
I won't be able to live with you,

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:58.850
...but keep this near you, and think of me always.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.240
Isn't it funny...

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:13.740
I couldn't remember it before, but now I remember clearly.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.940
The name of that beach...

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.480
Fukiko-sama -- so this is where you've been.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.820
Nanako-san, please come with us.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.830
We will take you home.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.170
OK.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.590
Nanako-san...

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:49.660
Yes?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:55.180
There is something I swore I'd never reveal to anyone else.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:17:01.600
But perhaps I could... ...yes, I do want to tell you.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:07.550
The truth is, Rei and I are not stepsister.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.790
We share both parents, and are full sisters.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:20.590
The woman I'd thought was my mother, on her deathbed,

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:26.150
...finally told me the truth before she passed away.

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.270
I thought the truth was too terrible to bear.

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:52.560
The father in whom I'd trusted had another woman.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:56.920
So I was not a true Ichinomiya, I was her child instead,

00:17:56.920 --> 00:18:00.270
...and I had a little sister too.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:05.870
So I felt great hatred for Rei -- or at least, I tried to.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.950
But I couldn't hate her.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:14.970
Because she is my sister.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.620
My only sister.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.220
I couldn't talk to Rei about it.

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:26.910
I knew if I told her, she would suffer more than ever.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.980
...at least, I thought so.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:33.940
But maybe I should have told her anyway.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:39.040
Perhaps then I could have loved her in a different way...

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.950
Saint-Juste-sama had known!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.250
I cried out silently within...

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:51.370
But I couldn't speak it aloud. I couldn't!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:01.430
How could this happen, Dear Brother?

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:07.000
Miya-sama and Saint-Juste-sama were unaware that the other one knew.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:11.080
Each protecting the other from the sad truth.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:17.930
Now I see the strong bond of love between the sisters.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:24.080
Love, strong beyond my comprehension... a bond of love.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:33.680
Brother, the two sisters entrusted me with this secret.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.430
I will guard this secret forever.

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:44.000
I will keep it in my heart, secured by a lock marked "forever".

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:38.980
It's sad, isn't it, how you and I ended up being such wonderful sisters.

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:41.990
It's sad that we have different mothers.

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:56.080
If we act now, we can stop time at this moment of beautiful sisterhood,

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.620
...nothing will ever take it away.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:04.160
Otherwise sadness will overtake us, and it will be too late.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:29.810
Miss? Are you traveling alone?

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.820
No. I'm with my younger sister.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.810
How wonderful.

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:44.630
If she is your sister, she must be very beautiful.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:49.860
Yes. We both take after our mother.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.960
Are you traveling far?

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.520
No...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:08.700
My journey is at an end... finally.

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:21.250
It is all over now, Rei.

00:22:40.070 --> 00:22:44.090
We will now discuss the petition submitted by the students,

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:47.170
...regarding the abolition of the Sorority.

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:50.050
Yes?

00:22:53.490 --> 00:22:54.760
Excuse me.

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.480
Ichinomiya-kun...

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:05.020
I'm sorry that you had to convene a meeting on the subject,

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:07.240
...but the discussion is not necessary.

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:12.650
As the president of the Sorority, and as its last member,

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:17.010
...I voluntarily request the dissolution of the Sorority.

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:35.350
Dear Brother...

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:38.580
The Sorority has been officially abolished.

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:44.130
For certain, something has ended, and something has changed.

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:50.370
And I am left with one fact only... that Saint-Juste-sama has passed away.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
